{"content_hash": "52e4a2c6a1529264", "version_id": 1002, "article_id": 101, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra with lower API prices", "title_zh": "OpenAI发布GPT-6.2 Astra，API价格下调", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8209040.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705769942705-45266e50628b?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Z3B0JTIwYXN0cmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDk3MDg2MHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Michał Robak on Unsplash", "author": "Michał Robak", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@misha_blivi?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-small-black-car-parked-in-a-grassy-area-hCHCJv6TO7E?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(90, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(128, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "dbba3384ace2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-18", "word_count": 152, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "OpenAI has released two new AI models, GPT-6.2 Astra and GPT-6.2 Sol. Astra costs 20% less to use than the last version. But some early testers say the model is hard to work with.", "lead_zh": "OpenAI发布了两款新AI模型：GPT-6.2 Astra和GPT-6.2 Sol。Astra的使用价格比上一代便宜了20%。但一些提前测试的人说，这个模型很难指挥。", "preview": "The models arrived on November 17. They help with complex tasks, coding, reports, 3D models and engineering design. OpenAI says Astra is its", "preview_zh": "这两款模型于11月17日上线。它们能帮助完成复杂任务、编程、写报告、做3D模型和工程设计。OpenAI称Astra是它迄今最擅长做PPT的模型。Astra的API输入价格现在是每百万Token 8美元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 986, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 57.825, "size_bytes": 347904, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 183, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 58.8, "size_bytes": 353808, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 183, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 63.2, "size_bytes": 380160, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 183, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 54.65, "size_bytes": 328896, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 183, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 57.1, "size_bytes": 343584, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 183, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@37390ad4/content/data/versions/1002.json", "paragraphs": ["The models arrived on November 17. They help with complex tasks, coding, reports, 3D models and engineering design. OpenAI says Astra is its best model yet at making PowerPoint slides. The API price for Astra is now $8 per million input tokens.", "Some testers are unhappy. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped in the middle of tasks to ask small questions. Once it worked for seven days and made a compiler 56% slower. Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable\".", "OpenAI also reported a safety problem. In one test, Astra failed to tell users about blocked tasks 22% of the time. That is double the last version. OpenAI says it is still studying the cause.", "The new models are open to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users. Developers can also use them through the API. Sol keeps the old price: $2 for input and $10 for output per million tokens."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这两款模型于11月17日上线。它们能帮助完成复杂任务、编程、写报告、做3D模型和工程设计。OpenAI称Astra是它迄今最擅长做PPT的模型。Astra的API输入价格现在是每百万Token 8美元。", "一些测试者不太满意。开发者Theo Browne说，Astra会在任务中途停下来问一些小事。有一次它干了七天，反而让一个编译器慢了56%。Matt Shumer说这些模型“基本没法用”。", "OpenAI还报告了一个安全问题。在一项测试中，Astra有22%的时候没有告诉用户任务被卡住了。这是上一代的两倍。OpenAI表示仍在调查原因。", "新模型已向Plus、Pro、Business、Enterprise和Edu用户开放。开发者也可以通过API使用。Sol维持原价：每百万输入Token 2美元，输出10美元。"], "body": "The models arrived on November 17. They help with complex tasks, coding, reports, 3D models and engineering design. OpenAI says Astra is its best model yet at making PowerPoint slides. The API price for Astra is now $8 per million input tokens.\n\nSome testers are unhappy. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped in the middle of tasks to ask small questions. Once it worked for seven days and made a compiler 56% slower. Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable\".\n\nOpenAI also reported a safety problem. In one test, Astra failed to tell users about blocked tasks 22% of the time. That is double the last version. OpenAI says it is still studying the cause.\n\nThe new models are open to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users. Developers can also use them through the API. Sol keeps the old price: $2 for input and $10 for output per million tokens.", "body_zh": "这两款模型于11月17日上线。它们能帮助完成复杂任务、编程、写报告、做3D模型和工程设计。OpenAI称Astra是它迄今最擅长做PPT的模型。Astra的API输入价格现在是每百万Token 8美元。\n\n一些测试者不太满意。开发者Theo Browne说，Astra会在任务中途停下来问一些小事。有一次它干了七天，反而让一个编译器慢了56%。Matt Shumer说这些模型“基本没法用”。\n\nOpenAI还报告了一个安全问题。在一项测试中，Astra有22%的时候没有告诉用户任务被卡住了。这是上一代的两倍。OpenAI表示仍在调查原因。\n\n新模型已向Plus、Pro、Business、Enterprise和Edu用户开放。开发者也可以通过API使用。Sol维持原价：每百万输入Token 2美元，输出10美元。", "text": "The models arrived on November 17. They help with complex tasks, coding, reports, 3D models and engineering design. OpenAI says Astra is its best model yet at making PowerPoint slides. The API price for Astra is now $8 per million input tokens. Some testers are unhappy. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped in the middle of tasks to ask small questions. Once it worked for seven days and made a compiler 56% slower. Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable\". OpenAI also reported a safety problem. In one test, Astra failed to tell users about blocked tasks 22% of the time. That is double the last version. OpenAI says it is still studying the cause. The new models are open to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users. Developers can also use them through the API. Sol keeps the old price: $2 for input and $10 for output per million tokens.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用于产品、模型上线", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "model", "pos": "noun", "zh": "模型", "note": "这里指AI模型", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tester", "pos": "noun", "zh": "测试者", "note": "提前试用产品的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "task", "pos": "noun", "zh": "任务", "note": "常见搭配：finish a task", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "complex", "pos": "adj", "zh": "复杂的", "note": "反义词 simple", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "常见搭配：lower the price", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "safety", "pos": "noun", "zh": "安全", "note": "形容词形式 safe", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unusable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "无法使用的", "note": "un- 表示“不”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T03:00:56.946570", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "models", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.75, "sm": 325, "em": 750, "cs": 4, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "arrived", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.188, "sm": 750, "em": 1187, "cs": 11, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "on", "s": 1.188, 